ATTRIBUTION

This mod is a derivative work. It is a port of the "Mind Over Matter" mod for
Cataclysm: Dark Days Ahead to Cataclysm: Bright Nights.

  Original mod:  Mind Over Matter, by Standing-Storm
                 https://github.com/Standing-Storm/MindOverMatter
                 now maintained in-tree at
