                 https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-DDA
                 licensed CC BY-SA 3.0

  Target game:   Cataclysm: Bright Nights, by the Bright Nights contributors
                 https://github.com/cataclysmbnteam/Cataclysm-BN

